
# Password Generator

## Description
A simple Python-based Password Generator that creates
secure and random passwords based on user preferences.

Users can choose the password length and select which
character types they want to include.

## Objective
To practice Python functions, modules, randomization,
user input, and secure programming concepts.

## Features
- Customizable password length
- Uppercase letter support
- Lowercase letter support
- Number support
- Special character support
- Secure password generation
- User-friendly interface

## How to Run

1. Install Python on your computer.
2. Download or clone this project.
3. Open the project folder in VS Code or Python IDLE.
4. Run the following command:

```bash
python password_generator.py
```

5. Enter your preferred password length.
6. Select the character types.
7. Your password will be generated.

